<title>JAPAN: Thailand says satsified with baht float.</title>
<headline>Thailand says satsified with baht float.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Finance Minister Thanong Bidaya told reporters on Friday that he was satisfied with how the managed float of the baht was proceeding.</p>
<p>Asked by reporters as he entered a meeting with Japanese Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka if he was satisfied with how the float was going, Thanong replied, &quot;yes&quot;.</p>
</text>
